    "detailed_description": "Multiplayer \u2018couch game\u2019 that can be played up to 4 players, gamepads are required to play locally.<br />\r\nThe primary purpose is to defeat others by hitting a ball so that it collides with the target, inflicting damage in the process.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nEach player has the ability to attack, dash and block, some actions require energy to be used. The attack can be held to increase its power, but there is also the possibility of using energy tokens to reach the full charge instantly.<br />\r\nWhen played with the joystick, the left stick is used for movement and the right stick is used for aiming.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThere are also several special interactions to spice things up.<br />\r\nFor example, blocking a ball only reduces the damage, but doing it with a perfect timing will catch the ball and restore the energy token to the receiver.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThis project is still early in development and I am currently working on:<br />\r\n-Online multiplayer (Photon PUN)<br />\r\n-Several power-ups that players can use.<br />\r\n-New game modes",
    "about_the_game": "Multiplayer \u2018couch game\u2019 that can be played up to 4 players, gamepads are required to play locally.<br />\r\nThe primary purpose is to defeat others by hitting a ball so that it collides with the target, inflicting damage in the process.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nEach player has the ability to attack, dash and block, some actions require energy to be used. The attack can be held to increase its power, but there is also the possibility of using energy tokens to reach the full charge instantly.<br />\r\nWhen played with the joystick, the left stick is used for movement and the right stick is used for aiming.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThere are also several special interactions to spice things up.<br />\r\nFor example, blocking a ball only reduces the damage, but doing it with a perfect timing will catch the ball and restore the energy token to the receiver.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThis project is still early in development and I am currently working on:<br />\r\n-Online multiplayer (Photon PUN)<br />\r\n-Several power-ups that players can use.<br />\r\n-New game modes",
